%H A401497 Scott R. Shannon, <a href="/A401497/a401497_10.jpg">Image for n = 38</a>. This is the first time that the n-th circle does not intersect with the 1st circle of radius 1 centered at the origin.
%H A401497 Scott R. Shannon, <a href="/A401497/a401497_11.jpg">Image for n = 100</a>.
%H A401497 Wikipedia, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Archimedean_spiral">Archimedean spiral</a>.
%F A401497 a(n) = A401499(n) - A401498(n) + 1, n > 1, by Euler's formula.
%F A401497 a(n) = n^2 - n + 1 for 1 <= n <= 15.
%F A401497 Distance between the circumferences of the 13th and 16th circles = sqrt(9 + 360*(1 - cos(3))) - sqrt(480*(1 - cos(1)) + 1) - sqrt(312*(1 - cos(1)) + 1) = 0.027398181493823... .
